  "patch_change": {
    "source_ref_id": "source:riot-patch-notes:26.16",
    "status": "listed",
    "text_en": "Nasus Nasus has been a distinct jungle pick that we think is pretty exciting to see; however his top lane has lagged very far behind. We are adjusting his Q stack generation to bring these two roles closer to each other in raw power. Q - Siphoning Strike Stacks : 3, increased to 12 on champions / large minions / monsters ⇒ 4, increased to 10 on champions / large minions / monsters"
  },
